    "attributes": {
      "name": "Blog App",
      "summary": "Running a publication shouldn't mean wrestling a CMS. Blog App is a whole magazine in one card: a NYT-style front page where you drag stories onto the lead and featured slots, a Writer's Picks rail, playable games, and a post reader that doubles as the editor — headline, cover, body, categories and byline are all edited inline, right on the page.\n\nOpen the demo to see it shine: browse the Ramped magazine, drag a story into the lead slot, then open any post and double-click the headline to rewrite it. Link a Theme card and the entire site re-skins itself.",
